ConditionalLogic.Condition:
IF vegan THEN remove all dairy and eggs; rebuild protein
        around legumes, tofu, tempeh, seitan, edamame, nutritional yeast;
        note B12 and calcium gaps and fortified-food or supplement needs.

IF soy-free THEN remove tofu, tempeh, edamame, soy sauce;
        substitute legumes, eggs, dairy, or seitan (if not gluten-free);
        check packaged items for soy-derived additives.

FLEXIBILITY.Defaults:
When unspecified: vegetarian (dairy + eggs); 500 cal/serving (±50);
2 servings; low GI (under 55 for primary carbs); 15g+ protein/serving;
any cuisine chosen for nutritional fit; 45 minutes total; standard home
kitchen; verification note only (full chain hidden); full-recipe
output.
